* PORT - READ OR WRITE AN I/O PORT

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* PORT - READ OR WRITE AN I/O PORT

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    PORT hex-port [hex-value]

Reads an I/O port when no value is supplied, or writes the given
hexadecimal value.

I/O ports control devices and cpmsim hardware functions. A write can halt
or reset the emulator. Do not experiment on the live service.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
